   "quote": "\"Revolut initially adopted GLM-5.1 before moving to GLM-5.3, which it now serves using 56 Nvidia B200 GPUs.\" / \"sub-3 second time to first token on context windows of around 256,000 tokens, and generation speeds of around 200 tokens a second\" / \"At $0.30 per million input/output tokens, self hosting GLM 5.1 cost about a tenth of using OpenAI's Codex or Anthropic's Claude Code.\"",
   "note": "Press account of David Abitbol's AI Engineer NYC talk (2026-10-13; video https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ok6QdZHCcI8, transcript not read). Register: tok/s and TTFT are what 'the sweet spot' means; percentile not stated. ws_model GLM52 = GLM-5.3 in Working Set.",
   "inputs": [],
   "use": "context"
  },
